      "value": "<div class=\"contentLayout2\">\n<div class=\"columnLayout two-right-sidebar\" data-layout=\"two-right-sidebar\">\n<div class=\"cell normal\" data-type=\"normal\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<h2 id=\"AddingMappingsforConcepts-Description\">Description</h2><p>A concept term defines a medical coding term or OpenMRS concept dictionary term that could be mapped to a concept. A concept map connects a concept term to a concept.  To understand Concepts and Mapping better, please refer to this documentation by OpenMRS: <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://wiki.openmrs.org/display/docs/Concept+Terms+and+Mappings\" rel=\"nofollow\">Concept Terms and Mapping (OpenMRS Wiki)</a>.</p><h2 id=\"AddingMappingsforConcepts-Steps\">Steps</h2><p>One can choose to directly add a reference term, or else, refer to a properties file key name, which will have its corresponding language translation in the property file at run time.</p><h3 id=\"AddingMappingsforConcepts-Case1:Addingadirectname\"><strong>Case 1: Adding a direct name</strong></h3><p>Here the code field of new reference term is just name </p><p><div class=\"embeddedObject conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"false\" data-macro-id=\"9afb5cd1-41eb-43ba-8400-ca037ce2bf5b\" data-macro-name=\"multimedia\">\n    <video src=\"/wiki/download/attachments/47775905/name-as-reference-term-source.mp4\" height=\"500\" width=\"700\" autoplay=\"\" controls=\"\">\n        Your browser does not support the HTML5 video element\n</video>\n\n</div></p><h3 id=\"AddingMappingsforConcepts-Case2:Addingakeyreference\"><strong style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\">Case 2: Adding a key reference</strong></h3><p>The code field of reference term Key(<strong style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">ETHAMBUTAL_KEY</span></strong>) is defined in the locale file <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/Bahmni/default-config/blob/master/openmrs/i18n/clinical/locale_en.json\" rel=\"nofollow\" style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\">https://github.com/Bahmni/default-config/blob/master/openmrs/i18n/clinical/locale_en.json</a></p><p> <div class=\"embeddedObject conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"false\" data-macro-id=\"bfbe2ae3-a188-4b14-8736-58b355702e9b\" data-macro-name=\"multimedia\">\n    <video src=\"/wiki/download/attachments/47775905/locale-key-as-reference-term-source.mp4\" height=\"500\" width=\"700\" autoplay=\"\" controls=\"\">\n        Your browser does not support the HTML5 video element\n</video>\n\n</div></p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cell aside\" data-type=\"aside\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-tip conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"3c15117e-dff4-4608-8180-2aebc11d25f7\" data-macro-name=\"tip\"><p class=\"title\">On this Page</p><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-approve confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p> </p><div class=\"toc-macro client-side-toc-macro  conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"false\" data-headerelements=\"H1,H2,H3,H4,H5,H6,H7\" data-macro-id=\"e8f0fdc3-7d76-4e0d-878a-5b0900f5429d\" data-macro-name=\"toc\"> </div><p> </p></div></div><div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"5246e26e-0440-4e20-9b43-02184be46fef\" data-macro-name=\"panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"panelHeader\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;background-color: #1FA5A0;color: white;\"><b>Related Links</b></div><div class=\"panelContent\">\n<p><a href=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/pages/editpage.action?pageId=47775905\" rel=\"nofollow\">Concept Terms and Mappings (OpenMRS Wiki)</a></p><p><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://wiki.openmrs.org/display/docs/Concept+Best+Practices\" rel=\"nofollow\">Concept Best Practices (OpenMRS Wiki)</a></p>\n</div></div><div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"7a78be22-9614-48ba-bd25-5dfe65c91d4b\" data-macro-name=\"panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"panelHeader\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;\"><b>Similar Pages</b></div><div class=\"panelContent\">\n<p> </p><div class=\"searchMacro conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"false\" data-macro-id=\"a001239c-16ee-446a-8589-ffd855c12b55\" data-macro-name=\"search\">\n    <h4 class=\"resultSummary\">\n                    Found <strong>5</strong> search result(s) for <strong>concept</strong>.\n         \n        </h4>\n\n    \t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"result\">\n            \n            \n                <span class=\"icon aui-icon content-type-page\" title=\"Page\">Page:</span>\n        <a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/5605195781/Enhancement+Support+for+Concept-Format+Attributes+in+the+Surgical+Appointment+Form\">Enhancement: Support for Concept-Format Attributes in the Surgical Appointment Form</a>\n    \n        <span class=\"smalltext\">(<a href=\"/wiki/display/BAH\">Bahmni Wiki</a>)</span>\n    \n<br />\n<span class=\"smalltext\">\n        \n    Aug 18, 2026\n\n        </span>\n\n    \n            </div>\n        \t\t\t<div class=\"result\">\n            \n            \n                <span class=\"icon aui-icon content-type-page\" title=\"Page\">Page:</span>\n        <a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/3251863630/Comparing+various+Concept+Dictionary+options+in+Bahmni\">Comparing various Concept Dictionary options in Bahmni</a>\n    \n        <span class=\"smalltext\">(<a href=\"/wiki/display/BAH\">Bahmni Wiki</a>)</span>\n    \n<br />\n<span class=\"smalltext\">\n        \n    Jan 25, 2024\n\n        </span>\n\n    \n            </div>\n        \t\t\t<div class=\"result\">\n            \n            \n                <span class=\"icon aui-icon content-type-page\" title=\"Page\">Page:</span>\n        <a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/50921567/Configure+Concept+or+Concept+Set\">Configure Concept or Concept Set</a>\n    \n        <span class=\"smalltex